    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>5级 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物（蜘蛛）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 72；''重伤'' 36</span><span>''先攻'' +5</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 17，''强韧'' 17，''反射'' 18，''意志'' 16</span><span>''侦查'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6，攀爬 6（蛛行）</span><span>''感官'' 黑暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}匕首（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+10vs.AC<br>命中：1d4+6 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}飞投匕首（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 5/10（一个生物）+10vs.AC<br>命中：1d4+6 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}四刃乱舞（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>效果：该蛛妖斗士进行四次下述攻击。攻击：近战 1（一个生物）10vs.AC<br>命中：1d4+3 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">移动动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">蛛丝✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>前提：该蛛妖斗士处于攀爬。<br>效果：该蛛妖斗士飞行 5 格。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（蛛妖）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 杂技+10</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 15（+4）</span><span>''敏捷'' 16（+5）</span><span>''感知'' 13（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 12（+3）</span><span>''智力'' 8（+1）</span><span>''魅力'' 10（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，精灵语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 8 把匕首</span></div></div>\n</div>",
